traits.descRaw:
The ally on the Blackthorn hex is sacrificed before combat, granting your champions Health. 

Blackthorn champions gain additional stats based on the sacrifice's Role, Star Level, and Cost.

{Set18.Trait.Blackthorn.Tooltip}

Gain <TFTCurveTable row="SeedsPerCast"/> seed when your strongest Ivern casts, plus <TFTCurveTable row="CombatStartSeeds"/> every combat. Ivern uses <TFTCurveTable row="SeedsToGrowHex"/> seeds to grow a hex on your board that grants a bonus to its occupant. 

